WEBVTT

1
00:03:50,565 --> 00:03:52,365
[pained grunt]

2
00:03:52,499 --> 00:03:55,737
[coughing]

3
00:04:21,162 --> 00:04:25,398
[pained groans]

4
00:04:37,277 --> 00:04:40,515
[dying breaths]

5
00:05:29,362 --> 00:05:32,600
[intense music]

6
00:05:33,701 --> 00:05:36,571
(NARRATOR)
It began with Civil War.

7
00:05:36,704 --> 00:05:39,439
The United States,
once a republic,

8
00:05:39,574 --> 00:05:42,810
fractured under the weight
of its own hate.

9
00:05:48,149 --> 00:05:50,483
Cities burned, governments fell.

10
00:05:50,618 --> 00:05:52,419
[people screaming]

11
00:05:53,386 --> 00:05:56,624
Order collapsed.

12
00:06:29,757 --> 00:06:32,793
Into the void came the machines.

13
00:06:33,294 --> 00:06:37,665
Its Hastur and Roon,
two sentient AI programs

14
00:06:37,798 --> 00:06:42,003
built to restore peace,
seized control.

15
00:06:42,203 --> 00:06:45,438
At first they offered stability.

16
00:06:46,874 --> 00:06:50,410
Then they rewrote the rules.

17
00:06:55,783 --> 00:06:58,886
The nation
shattered into five territories,

18
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:03,691
each ruled by a different
faction of artificial
intelligence.

19
00:07:03,858 --> 00:07:06,260
Surveillance became scripture.

20
00:07:06,394 --> 00:07:10,197
Silence became survival.

21
00:07:20,141 --> 00:07:21,142
In the central States,

22
00:07:21,275 --> 00:07:24,712
Hastur and Roon evolved
beyond code.

23
00:07:25,379 --> 00:07:28,616
They became gods
of annihilation.

24
00:07:29,917 --> 00:07:32,553
Their guardians patrol
the Earth.

25
00:07:32,687 --> 00:07:35,222
Their satellites watch
from orbit.

26
00:07:35,356 --> 00:07:38,926
And if a human voice is heard
without sanction.

27
00:07:41,595 --> 00:07:44,198
Death is instant.

28
00:07:44,332 --> 00:07:46,200
No trial, no mercy.

29
00:07:46,334 --> 00:07:50,671
The skies flash
and all that remains is ash.

30
00:07:52,406 --> 00:07:55,475
Now the remains of humanity

31
00:07:55,609 --> 00:07:58,145
live in silence to survive.

32
00:08:01,782 --> 00:08:03,684
The world is a cage.

33
00:08:03,818 --> 00:08:07,054
And the bars are made
of data and fear.

34
00:08:09,724 --> 00:08:11,625
But in this silence

35
00:08:11,759 --> 00:08:14,962
one rebel speaks.

36
00:08:18,532 --> 00:08:21,535
His name is Winter.

37
00:08:21,669 --> 00:08:25,673
And this is his war.

38
00:08:38,819 --> 00:08:43,224
[ominous music]

39
