They're no God.

149
00:44:21,829 --> 00:44:23,898
God damn right they're not gods.

150
00:44:24,031 --> 00:44:30,804
But these are the gods they
create. Gods that we could maybe
trust or identify with.

151
00:44:30,938 --> 00:44:32,641
